                    insight_won:            `You won the way Cumeeira wins: a diagnosis-led, tailored journey, priced honestly above the 30% floor, sold on business outcomes. You out-designed the R$5.8M brand and out-valued the R$2.5M commodity — and you can actually staff it.`,
                    insight_unstaffable:    `A beautiful, well-diagnosed design that breaks the 30% margin floor is a wish, not a proposal — the unit won't staff it. Design and pricing are one decision; you protected the design but not the commercial model.`,
                    insight_misdiagnosed:   `You designed against the written brief, not the real problem. A generic leadership program — however polished — is exactly what the R$2.5M rival and the R$5.8M brand sell. Without the diagnosis, you had nothing only Cumeeira could offer.`,
                    insight_generic:        `Your proposal was safe but generic — defensible on margin, beatable on price. The diagnosis is the differentiator; lean harder on the real problem and the board-level outcomes next time.`,
                    insight_marginfloor:    `You ended below the 30% contribution-margin floor. Cumeeira declines work it can't staff profitably — protecting impact means finding margin elsewhere (reuse, faculty blend, cohort design), not breaching the floor.`,
                    insight_account:        `By matching the low-cost rival or conceding the full cut, you signalled the price was always soft — putting the wider R$11M Aratu account at risk at the next renewal. You don't win a commodity fight by becoming a commodity.`,
                    insight_featurepitch:   `Projected impact stayed low: the CHRO never heard what changes in her managers' behaviour or her business metrics. Selling modalities and faculty CVs to a board-facing buyer loses the outcome story.`,
                    insight_differentiator: `Diagnosis, design and impact moving together above a healthy margin — this is the diagnosis-led proposal that defends full price against both rivals. The reframe was the whole game.`,

